  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: spring-security-core 6.5.7.rhlw-00002",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released org.springframework.security:spring-security-core 6.5.7.rhlw-00002 with backported fixes for CVE-2026-22746 and CVE-2026-22751.\n\nCVE-2026-22746: User Attribute Enumeration when Using DaoAuthenticationProvider\n\nCVE-2026-22751: Spring Security JdbcOneTimeTokenService allows a one-time token to authenticate multiple sessions\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for org.springframework.security:spring-security-core 6.5.7 from Maven Central.",
